    "detailed_description": "A nice little timewaster, you drive on an endless highway, constantly avoiding other cars (or, if you've got the upgrades, simply ramming them to make them disappear).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMostly you'll drive left and right, but you can move forward and backwards a few meters as well. The objective is to not crash and gather up as many disks as you can.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe disks you collect remain yours even if you crash, so if you drive for an hour or repeatedly for a few minutes, you'll get to keep what is yours. Until you spend them to get cool upgrades, of course :-)",
    "about_the_game": "A nice little timewaster, you drive on an endless highway, constantly avoiding other cars (or, if you've got the upgrades, simply ramming them to make them disappear).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMostly you'll drive left and right, but you can move forward and backwards a few meters as well. The objective is to not crash and gather up as many disks as you can.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe disks you collect remain yours even if you crash, so if you drive for an hour or repeatedly for a few minutes, you'll get to keep what is yours. Until you spend them to get cool upgrades, of course :-)",
    "short_description": "A &quot;driving&quot; game of sorts. You can move left and right, and a bit forward and back. Don't collide with other cars, and collect as many disks as you can.",
